<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27724" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ης</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thirst,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τε καὶ λιμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.166
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖνα καὶ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					585a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψῃ ξυνέχεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of trees, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				231.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				176.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1154b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>thirst for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					437d
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδᾶν δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					9.104
				</span></i>
			.—The form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψη</span></b>  occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.339
			</span></i>, and in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				756
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψος.</span></div>
